From fdde8881eef070c36a91c5a0a0c2ec63f84bf9e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:08:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: Reaper_v3.4.2

Thirteen fixes since v3.4.0 (the withdrawn beta): the kernel from_timer
guard, the setup page's DST rule, the stock wizard reachable from AiMesh
add-node only and the themed add-node window, a fixed WAN port and the
three DNSMASQ switches off at factory, diag v1.3.37, rwatch on a pre-NTP
clock, lldpd CVE-2026-46433, Samba's private dir 0700, the OpenVPN 2.7.8
backports, the LAN name check's one-wait probe, the Failover poll,
rv6names per-instance reload.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 70ec979bc53..0813f08ea9a 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.0
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.2
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
